   train: 10.000 filas,  batch = 100  ->  100 batches

   +---------+  +---------+  +---------+           +---------+
   | batch 1 |  | batch 2 |  | batch 3 |    ...    |batch 100|
   +---------+  +---------+  +---------+           +---------+
        |            |            |                     |
     forward      forward      forward               forward
     backward     backward     backward              backward
     1 ajuste     1 ajuste     1 ajuste              1 ajuste

   |<------------------------ 1 epoca ------------------------>|
                     100 ajustes de los pesos

